B.Ys=s(["Ota\u011f\u0131 y\xfckseltmeden \xf6nce ia\u015fe ve odun stoklar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 dengeli tutun.","Her ota\u011f seviyesi yeni pazar kurlar\u0131 ve t\xf6re ferman\u0131 slotlar\u0131 sa\u011flar."],t.s)
