B.QH=new A.bw("biome_symbiosis",B.ln,"Ekolojik Simbiyoz (Hibrid Arazi Mutasyonu)","Ecological Symbiosis Engine","Kom\u015fu biyomlar\u0131n birbirini etkilemesiyle ortaya \xe7\u0131kan 4 gizli hibrid arazi mutasyonu.","4 hidden hybrid land mutations created by matching neighboring biomes.","Farkl\u0131 biyomlar yan yana fethedildi\u011finde do\u011fa rezonansa girer ve merkez karoda Simbiyoz mutasyonu olu\u015fur:\n\n1. Vah\u015fi Koruluk (Wild Glade): \xc7ay\u0131r etraf\u0131nda en az 2 Orman ve 1 Sazl\u0131k oldu\u011funda olu\u015fur. \u015eifal\u0131 polen ve +%40 ia\u015fe/odun verir.\n2. Kanyon Vahas\u0131 (Canyon Oasis): \xc7\xf6l ve Da\u011f karolar\u0131 en az 2'\u015fer kom\u015fu oldu\u011funda olu\u015fur. Tuz, baharat ve +%50 kervan alt\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar.\n3. Kristal P\u0131nar (Crystal Spring): Deniz/G\xf6l ile Da\u011f kom\u015fu oldu\u011funda a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r. Saf kaynak suyu ve +%40 maden h\u0131z\u0131 verir.\n4. Jeotermal Gayzer (Volcanic Geothermal): Yanarda\u011f ile Tundra/Sazl\u0131k kom\u015fu oldu\u011funda patlar. Do\u011fal buhar \u0131s\u0131s\u0131yla donmay\u0131 engeller ve +%60 h\u0131z auras\u0131 yayar.","Neighboring biomes trigger organic mutations: Wild Glade (Meadow+Forest+Wetland), Canyon Oasis (Desert+Mountain), Crystal Spring (Sea+Mountain), and Volcanic Geothermal (Volcano+Tundra).",B.So,B.bw,"4 H\u0130BR\u0130D REZONANS",B.a1k,B.ZH,B.Zg,B.Va,B.Wo,B.W5)
