B.Yo=s(["K\u0131m\u0131z Ota\u011f\u0131 a\xe7\u0131lmadan \xf6nce arpa stoklamak h\u0131zl\u0131 k\u0131m\u0131z \xfcretimini garanti eder."],t.s)
